Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.00,0:17:13.70,Title,0,0,0,0,,《生化危机：复仇》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.99,0:02:04.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（墨西哥 克雷塔罗地区）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.10,0:19:55.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（四个月后 芝加哥）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.32,0:23:27.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（100%匹配）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.74,0:23:35.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（原型疫苗已完成）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.41,0:23:37.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（已分割并转移至注射器）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.16,0:23:38.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（已存储于制冷设备中）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.94,0:25:29.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（计算化学系统）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.56,0:32:18.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（逃生平面图）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.36,0:36:39.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（科罗拉多 洛基山脉）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.82,0:52:43.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（潜伏病毒 触发病毒 疫苗）
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.44,1:01:00.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纽约警局 安东尼·石冢）
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.25,1:10:59.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（打开）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.92,0:01:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}儿时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was a kid, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.18,0:01:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我常想我长大后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to think about the kind of man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.95,0:01:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会是什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd grow up to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.73,0:01:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从未想到我的人生会变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought my life would turn out this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.67,0:02:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是克里斯·雷德菲尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're Chris Redfield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.37,0:02:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}活死人方面的专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The expert on the living dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.31,0:02:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你肯定杀过很多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet you killed a lot, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.34,0:02:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 专家先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Mr. Expert, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么对付他们的建议吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}any advice on dealing with them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.27,0:02:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got friends? Heh, heh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.39,0:02:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. I got friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.59,0:02:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 家人呢 - 有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Family? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.46,0:02:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有妻子 父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a wife. My folks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.24,0:02:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有个小妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.76,0:02:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有公司在制造\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's corporations out there creating viruses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.08,0:02:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把人变成生化武器的病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}turning people into bioweapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.44,0:02:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}目标包括你我\N{\fnArial\fs30}People like you and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有你朋友 你家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends. Family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有朝一日 你将面临一个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will come a day when you'll be faced with a decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.35,0:03:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.88,0:03:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}or be killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.58,0:03:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听上去并不是很英雄的行为 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't sound very heroic, does it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.29,0:03:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.86,0:03:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们正在接近目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're approaching the target, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.20,0:03:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们再全过一遍 确保不会出错\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let's go over everything one more time so there's no mistakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.84,0:03:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}目标是格伦·阿里亚斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The target is Glenn Arias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.57,0:03:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他因贩卖武器被全球通缉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's wanted internationally for weapons trafficking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.41,0:03:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卖的可不是M16步枪和简易爆炸装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're not talking about M16s and IEDs here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.37,0:03:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是尖端的玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking cutting-edge shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.41,0:03:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他喜欢跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He likes doing business{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.42,0:03:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有重大冲突的地方做生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}anywhere there's a major conflict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.71,0:03:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}情报显示 阿里亚斯现有一种BOW\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intel says that Arias is now in possession of a BOW, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即 生化有机武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}a.k.a. bioorganic weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以BSAA（生化恐怖防御与评估联盟）会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why the BSAA is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.39,0:03:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们懂得如何对付那些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know how to handle those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.53,0:03:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的一名卧底 卡西·怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of our undercover agents, Cathy White, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:04:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}数周前 和他儿子扎克一同失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}went missing weeks ago, along with her son, Zack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天我们有两个任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have two objectives today:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.64,0:04:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并抓获格伦·阿里亚斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and grab Glenn Arias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.12,0:04:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通讯检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comm check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.49,0:04:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}馆外没有动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}No movement outside the compound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.89,0:04:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}分成三队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Split up into three teams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:04:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.13,0:05:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.29,0:08:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.81,0:09:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.89,0:09:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}扎克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.30,0:11:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雷德菲尔德 回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redfield, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人吗 到底是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody. What the hell's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}立即撤离 快去直升机那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency evac. Get the chopper now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.97,0:12:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.22,0:13:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿里亚斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.25,0:14:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多亏了你 我不得不把生意转至别处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to you, I'll have to move my business somewhere else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.32,0:14:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你个王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.09,0:15:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.39,0:15:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是个生意人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a businessman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.73,0:15:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把好产品向任何有意购买的人提供\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make good products available to anyone who wants to buy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}且价格合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at reasonable prices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.24,0:15:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如 这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example, this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.31,0:15:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}精美范本\N{\fnArial\fs30}exquisite specimen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.42,0:15:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cathy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.97,0:15:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在地球上的最后时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last moments on Earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.06,0:15:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是最美的 你不觉得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are the most beautiful, don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.55,0:16:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的产品就好在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wonderful thing about my products{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.55,0:16:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们知道盟友与敌人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that they know the difference between ally{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.09,0:16:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}and enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.63,0:17:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 恭喜 - 恭喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Congratulations! - Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.97,0:19:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.27,0:19:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一切都是为了你 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all for you, my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.71,0:19:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Sara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.08,0:20:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.42,0:20:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这个病毒让所有人发疯的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the virus that's making everyone flip out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.93,0:20:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}情况越来越糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It keeps getting worse and worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.93,0:20:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到处都有袭击发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attacks are happening all over the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.43,0:20:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从哪弄到这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you get this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.00,0:20:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以前没见过这段影像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen this footage before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.97,0:20:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个还没被公开\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hasn't been released yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.44,0:20:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们不希望公众恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't want the public to panic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.91,0:20:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在跟我开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美国已有20次袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been like 20 attacks in the U.S. already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.81,0:20:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}BSAA在努力加以控制 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The BSAA is working to keep it under control, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.55,0:20:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但在我们找到原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it'll just keep happening{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.45,0:21:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阻止它之前 仍会持续发生 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we find the cause and stop it, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.12,0:21:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.72,0:21:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是故意而为的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is being done intentionally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们能找到幕后黑手…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can just find out who's behind it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.76,0:21:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}焦糖玛奇朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caramel macchiato?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.36,0:21:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没忘巧克力片吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you remember the chocolate chips?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顶部还有生奶油\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the whipped cream on top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.07,0:21:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是甜点 不是咖啡 你知道的 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's dessert, not coffee. You know that, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.97,0:21:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.61,0:21:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么 钱伯斯教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Nothing at all, Professor Chambers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.95,0:21:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死人复活 被用作生化武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead coming back to life and being used as bioweapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.69,0:21:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些疯子公司在这国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}These insane corporations have caused{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.59,0:21:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}造成了太多悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}far too much tragedy in this country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.86,0:21:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得都一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is more of the same, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.63,0:21:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.17,0:21:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据以前的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Based on what's happened before, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.67,0:21:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次感觉不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}this time it feels different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.17,0:21:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能有新的幕后黑手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone new could be behind it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.87,0:21:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是疫苗模拟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the vaccine simulation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.78,0:21:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次的受感染者显现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The infected are exhibiting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.85,0:22:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不同的特性\N{\fnArial\fs30}different traits this time around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.55,0:22:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在试图抑制人造病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm attempting to suppress the artificial virus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.75,0:22:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为它似乎是感染的基础\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it seems to be the base of the infection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.55,0:22:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到计算化学系统在运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the computational chemistry system running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.66,0:22:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已在制造试验药物了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we making a test drug already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.42,0:22:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.86,0:22:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多年来 我们的技术已有很大进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our technology's come so far over the years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.03,0:22:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}制造一个样品用不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}making a sample doesn't take that long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.56,0:22:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, by the way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.67,0:22:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新的一批受感染尸体被送来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we got another delivery of infected bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.80,0:22:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有很多 30具以上\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot. More than 30.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.54,0:22:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁在取样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's getting the samples?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.14,0:22:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天学生们都出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The students are all out today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.01,0:22:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.58,0:22:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是博士后 我不做那种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. I'm postdoc. I don't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.75,0:22:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 悉听尊便 钱伯斯教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Anything you say, Professor Chambers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.02,0:22:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.06,0:23:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.55,0:27:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亚伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.68,0:27:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.01,0:28:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.45,0:28:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.45,0:28:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这像是谋划好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like it was planned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.54,0:30:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瑞贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.61,0:30:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 克里斯 - 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chris? - You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.55,0:31:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.50,0:31:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你该穿件防护服 或起码戴个面罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be wearing a clean-suit or at least a mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.10,0:31:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.54,0:31:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.67,0:31:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}目前挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine for now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.34,0:31:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怎么不被检疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}But shouldn't I be in quarantine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.55,0:31:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.58,0:31:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}病毒若真那么容易传染\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the virus really was that contagious, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.98,0:31:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们早就都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'd all be dead already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.45,0:31:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另外 检疫要很久 我现在就需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, quarantine takes too long, and I need you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.39,0:31:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}So don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.43,0:31:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会让你冲个热水澡 然后一切都会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get you to a hot shower, and everything will be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.36,0:31:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还是老样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same old Chris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.20,0:31:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警方报告称 嫌犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police reports say the suspects{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.37,0:31:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是武装恐怖份子\N{\fnArial\fs30}were armed terrorists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.21,0:31:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到目前为止 死亡人数据称已超过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, the number of dead is reported to be over…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.54,0:31:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芝加哥郊外小镇的大屠杀…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mass killing in this town outside of Chicago is under…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.31,0:32:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天 一家房车公园内的突发暴力事件致使数十人遇难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sudden outbreak of violence at a caravan park claimed dozens of victims today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.42,0:32:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安大略的特别任务部队宣称\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ontario's special task force has declared{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.45,0:32:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已控制局势 同时 这可能是此事件的官方声明…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the situation under control. While that might be the official statement on the incident…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.21,0:32:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.10,0:32:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不像是在休息啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't look like you're resting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.20,0:32:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}热水澡有奇效\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hot shower does wonders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.21,0:32:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这是你从实验室拿来的数据吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that the data you took from the lab? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.32,0:32:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然我们知道这试验药物能用作疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that we know the test drug works as a vaccine, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.61,0:32:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就必须把它尽快送到其他实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to send this out to other labs ASAP.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.38,0:32:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让它大量生产得越早\N{\fnArial\fs30}The faster we get this mass-produced, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.59,0:32:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能救的生命就越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more lives we can save.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.59,0:32:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.73,0:32:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你来这是有原因的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a reason you're here, isn't there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.30,0:32:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在追捕某人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're after someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.53,0:32:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他叫格伦·阿里亚斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a man named Glenn Arias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.53,0:32:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.77,0:33:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他接手了新保护伞和三联的运营\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took over Neo Umbrella and Tricell's operations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.74,0:33:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在他在把它们创造的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's selling the weapons they created{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.14,0:33:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卖给犯罪集团及交战国\N{\fnArial\fs30}to crime syndicates and countries at war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.24,0:33:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个死亡贩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a merchant of death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.38,0:33:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用雇佣军和BOW帮他做肮脏的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}using mercenaries and BOWs to do his dirty work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.75,0:33:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.19,0:33:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死人再次崛起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dead are rising again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.69,0:33:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定阿里亚斯是幕后黑手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're sure Arias is behind it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.39,0:33:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确定 在我发现你的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. After I found out that your research{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.39,0:33:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是世界上最先进的之后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}was the most advanced in the world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.10,0:33:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就乘上直升机来找我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hopped on a chopper and came to see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.20,0:33:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.57,0:33:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我看到你的实验室被毁得有多糟之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after I saw how trashed your lab was, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.10,0:33:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就觉得坏人也知道你的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}it looks like the bad guys knew about your research too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.37,0:33:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向世卫组织报告了我们的初步结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… I reported our initial findings to the WHO.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.41,0:33:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后他们把它发送给了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they sent it to facilities{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.48,0:33:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界各地专攻疫苗的机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}all over the world that specialize in vaccines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.38,0:33:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中任一机构都可能泄露出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The leak could've come from any of those places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.38,0:33:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.15,0:33:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿里亚斯想破坏你的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arias wanted to disrupt your research.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.15,0:33:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在他有了你的数据 就更危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now that he's got your data, he's even more dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.16,0:33:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我比较了新病毒的DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}I compared the new virus's DNA{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.36,0:33:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和手头所有的生化武器资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}to all the bioweapons we have on file.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.87,0:34:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}基因序列极其接近光明异教用的寄生武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sequence is extremely close to the parasitic weapons used by the Los Iluminados cult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.67,0:34:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为阿里亚斯可能是他们的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Arias might be one of'em?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.21,0:34:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我现有信息来看 我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Based on information I have now, I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.51,0:34:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来我们该去跟一位真正的专家谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we should go talk to a real expert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.35,0:34:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真正的专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real expert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.47,0:34:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真不敢相信这种时候你还看得进书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you can read a book at a time like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.21,0:34:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想这是消磨时间的一种方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it's one way to pass the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.91,0:34:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人曾说 知识就是力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, someone once said, "Knowledge is power."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.31,0:34:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯·培根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francis Bacon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.45,0:34:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只需一颗子弹 就能打倒敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It only takes one bullet to bring your enemy down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.39,0:34:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但有了知识 你就能击败所有邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with knowledge, you can defeat all evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.53,0:35:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 他们说的是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, is it true what they say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.23,0:35:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从特种队员变成了科学怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You switched from special ops to science geek?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.64,0:35:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天呐 BSAA全是有奇怪履历的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, the BSAA's chock-full of people with weird resumes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.74,0:35:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定一直都很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet you were pretty brainy to start with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.21,0:35:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你为何转职\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why'd you switch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.88,0:35:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说来话长\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.82,0:35:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾是浣熊市特战救援队的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to be a medic in the S.T.A.R.S. Unit in Raccoon City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.59,0:35:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得 某种程度上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess, in a way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.26,0:35:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直对医学科学感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always been interested in medical science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.32,0:35:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后来有一天 我决定把它作为职责 来阻止人们滥用它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then one day, I decided to make it my duty to stop people from abusing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.71,0:35:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}心想 这些公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought, " Here are these corporations, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.33,0:35:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被人渣管理 捕掠弱者\N{\fnArial\fs30}run by scum, preying on the weak."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.97,0:35:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像人类身上的疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're like a disease on humanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.87,0:35:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想找到解药 就和克里斯一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to find a cure, same as Chris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.74,0:35:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不同在于 他用肌肉 我用大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The difference is, he uses his brawn while I use my brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.58,0:35:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以大脑和肌肉一同合作拯救人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}So brains and brawns working together to save humanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.85,0:35:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得你们有多大机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think your chances are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.52,0:36:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你这是什么意思 达米安 - 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that supposed to mean, Damian? - Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.25,0:36:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是 如果这疾病就没解药呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just, like, uh, what if this disease don't got no cure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.39,0:36:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们追捕的那些混蛋 他们对待生死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The assholes we're after, they treat life and death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.93,0:36:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像掷骰子\N{\fnArial\fs30}like they shooting craps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.76,0:36:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一群垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunch of dicks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.77,0:36:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 我刚发现DC和达米安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I just realized DC and Damian{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.77,0:36:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次没谈论绝命毒师\N{\fnArial\fs30}aren't talking about Breaking Bad for once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.37,0:36:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 别开这头 克里斯 - 这剧很超前\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, don't go there, Chris. - That shit's ahead of its time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.51,0:36:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是了不起的杰作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a goddamn masterpiece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.33,0:37:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}注意点 可别吓到当地人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful you don't scare the locals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.75,0:37:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的潜行技术太渣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your stealth's for shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.88,0:37:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喝那么多酒有点早 里昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little early to be that deep in the bottle, Leon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.02,0:37:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看谁来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look who it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.86,0:37:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}BSAA的金童和厚望博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The BSAA's golden boy and Dr. High Hopes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.96,0:37:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们到底有什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.69,0:37:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有个任务 我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a job. We need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.57,0:37:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on vacation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.80,0:37:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们来谈谈光明教\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk about Los Iluminados.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.51,0:37:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}记得他们用的哪种BOW吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the type of BOWs they were using?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.04,0:37:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是很久以前的事 我不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's so long ago, I don't remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.38,0:37:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后呢 你就在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, you just gonna sit around here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.91,0:37:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再坐一周 什么也不做\N{\fnArial\fs30}another week and do nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.65,0:37:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从不考虑那么长远\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never make plans that far ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.35,0:37:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 再来一瓶 - 别给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. Another bottle here. - Cancel that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.92,0:37:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 你以为… - 够了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, who the hell do you…? - Enough! All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.49,0:37:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想怎么样 雷德菲尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, Redfield?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.10,0:37:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想怎么样 里昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, Leon? Heh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.40,0:37:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别喝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.87,0:38:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计们 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.37,0:38:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里昂 很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leon, I'm sorry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.84,0:38:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打扰你休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}to interrupt your vacation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.54,0:38:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但事情不严重我们也不会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we wouldn't be here if it wasn't serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.01,0:38:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们觉得你可能有些情报 我们现在就需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think you might have some intel, and we need it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.12,0:38:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}What intel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.14,0:38:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}二号目标已确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second target confirmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.04,0:38:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}留她活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}She stays alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.61,0:38:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干掉其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.44,0:38:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.73,0:38:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 这玩意儿传播得又快又广\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this shit's spreading fast and thick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.86,0:39:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我大学里的所有研究员和职工都被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of the researchers and staff at my university were infected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.93,0:39:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This again, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.37,0:39:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就像被困在一个该死的循环之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like I'm stuck in a goddamn loop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.54,0:39:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么 - 你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.81,0:39:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道在特区爆炸的那炸弹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that bomb that went off in DC?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.88,0:39:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时我的任务就是阻止恐怖份子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it was my mission to stop the terrorists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.88,0:39:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们到了汇合点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to our rendezvous point{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.99,0:39:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}某个混蛋出卖了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some asshole ratted us out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.12,0:39:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}炸弹爆炸了 都市特警队的所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bomb went off and everyone on Metro S.W.A.T., {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.23,0:39:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的整支队伍 全死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}my whole unit, gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.90,0:39:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直不停地战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep fighting and fighting, and fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.77,0:39:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可情况只是越来越糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And instead of seeing an end to this shit, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.67,0:39:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看不到这一切的终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}it just keeps getting worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.14,0:39:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的人生就该如此吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what my life's supposed to be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.11,0:39:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对抗活死人和制造他们的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighting the living dead and the bastards that make'em?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.68,0:39:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一切的意义是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point of it all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.65,0:39:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.68,0:39:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是格伦·阿里亚斯 一个军火贩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Glenn Arias, an arms dealer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.25,0:39:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在黑市的交易非常见不得人\N{\fnArial\fs30}His deals on the black market are so shady{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.62,0:39:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这让他登上了政府的刺杀名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}they landed him on a certain government's hit list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.22,0:40:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一颗制导炸弹在他婚礼上从天而降\N{\fnArial\fs30}A smart bomb was dropped on his wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.23,0:40:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于是他失去了他的家人和妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lost his family and his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.13,0:40:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在他满腔怨恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he's got a grudge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.80,0:40:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被袭之后 他隐匿了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the attack, he went underground, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.13,0:40:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但现在他带着BOW回来清算旧账了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but now he's back with BOWs and a score to settle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.51,0:40:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不可思议的是 他说他的产品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the kicker, he said his products{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.11,0:40:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能辨识目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}have targeting capabilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.94,0:40:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就我所见而言 我相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what I've seen, I believe him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.78,0:40:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以一边是军火贩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you got an arms dealer on one side, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.22,0:40:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}and on the other, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.09,0:40:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是在婚礼上投炸弹的政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}a government dropping bombs on weddings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.63,0:40:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 谁是坏蛋 - 阿里亚斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's the bad guy here? - Arias!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.59,0:40:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的任务就是拿下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's our mission to bring his ass down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.73,0:40:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是你的任务 不是我的 - 该死的 里昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your mission, not mine! - Goddamn it, Leon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.30,0:40:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别这样 里昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Leon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.60,0:40:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生了这么多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}With everything that's going on, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.30,0:40:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你只是坐在这里 为自己感到遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}you just sit here and feel sorry for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.94,0:40:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你 你在让怨恨支配你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you? You're letting a grudge get the better of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.11,0:40:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}God…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.65,0:40:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真不敢相信你俩竟如此相似\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot believe how alike you two are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.78,0:40:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.20,0:41:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们现在表现得就像两个自私的小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're acting like a couple of selfish brats right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.34,0:41:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}病毒就在我们的鼻子之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The virus is right under our noses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.04,0:41:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一直如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always has been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.81,0:41:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.48,0:41:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不用找阿里亚斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need to look for some new virus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.28,0:41:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感染人用的新病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Arias is infecting people with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.25,0:41:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}病毒就蛰伏在每一个人的体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}The virus is lying dormant inside of everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.19,0:41:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.16,0:41:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要找的是触发物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we need to find is the trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.09,0:41:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}某个激活潜伏病毒的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something activates the latent virus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.33,0:41:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有阿里亚斯知道是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and only Arias knows what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.13,0:41:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但在我们找到之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But until we find that out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.87,0:41:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每个人 无论生死 都是他的潜在武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone, living and dead, are his potential weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.74,0:41:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们不马上搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't figure this out right now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.37,0:41:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就不会再有这样的小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}there won't be little towns like this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.87,0:41:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让你借酒消愁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you to drink your sorrows away in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.88,0:41:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永远不会再有\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.91,0:42:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我创造了一种疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I created a vaccine, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.61,0:42:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在自己身上试了 它奏效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I tried it on myself and it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.32,0:42:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但在我们搞清阿里亚斯如何触发病毒之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But until we find out how Arias triggers the virus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.22,0:42:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁又知道它是否对其他人同样有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knows if it'll work the same for everyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.96,0:42:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的血藏有答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}My blood holds the answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.20,0:42:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我死了就把它交给你们信任的实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I die, get this to a lab you trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.34,0:42:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无法想象你俩所经历的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't imagine what you two have been through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.34,0:42:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我知道你俩没一个是那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know that neither one of you are the type of person{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.74,0:42:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会在世界毁灭之际还坐着争论的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who would sit here and argue while the world dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.15,0:42:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们不是那种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.25,0:42:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是说你们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.97,0:43:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我那么说不是很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't very nice of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.92,0:43:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.96,0:44:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帕特里西奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patricio!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.17,0:44:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}慢着 听我解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait! Let me explain. Unh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.93,0:44:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 里昂 - 这就是我说的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leon! - That guy I told you about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.17,0:44:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 出卖我队伍的那个人 - 你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The one that sold out my unit. - You don't understand. Unh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.21,0:44:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 就是这家伙 - 请别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is the guy. - Please, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.48,0:44:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 你干嘛 - 公事 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! What do you…? - Official business. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.05,0:44:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 里昂 别这样 - 你想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leon, come on! - What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.82,0:44:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别这样 你是我唯一认识的安全维和组织人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. You're the only one I know from the DSO.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.19,0:44:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的家人 你必须救救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my family. You've got to save them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.76,0:44:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.39,0:44:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的妻子和女儿都在西班牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife and my daughter are in Spain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.36,0:44:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}光明教馀党在出钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}An arms dealer is getting paid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.93,0:44:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给一个军火贩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the surviving members of Los Iluminados{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.93,0:44:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发动大规模的生化恐袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}to launch a large-scale bioterror attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.04,0:44:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道得太多 他们要杀了我和我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know too much. They're going to kill me and my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.81,0:44:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听到他说的没 今天是我们的幸运日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear what he said? It's our lucky day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.08,0:44:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幸运 你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Lucky"? Are you crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.91,0:44:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他能带我们找到目标 - 你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's gonna lead us to our guy. - What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.12,0:44:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格伦·阿里亚斯 这名字耳熟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name Glenn Arias ring a bell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.82,0:44:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你怎么知道 - 我会读心术\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know? - I'm psychic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.16,0:45:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要你的帮助 我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help! My family!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.13,0:45:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来帮你搞搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get this straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.16,0:45:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想害死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try and get me killed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.83,0:45:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在却要我救你家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now I'm supposed to save your family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.13,0:45:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.84,0:45:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你先告诉我们你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell us what you know first, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.54,0:45:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我们再决定是否帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we'll decide if we help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.15,0:45:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.85,0:46:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被跟踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was followed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.16,0:46:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.89,0:46:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.23,0:46:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救救她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.27,0:46:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.24,0:46:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瑞贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.37,0:46:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一号目标已击杀 二号目标已活捉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target one down. Target two secured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.43,0:46:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}DC 他们在旅店攻击了我们 还带走了瑞贝卡 追踪他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}DC, they hit us at the hotel and took Rebecca. Track'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.91,0:46:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认得那大家伙 他是阿里亚斯的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the big guy. He's with Arias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.64,0:46:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿里亚斯为什么想要瑞贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Arias want with Rebecca?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.21,0:47:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道 我只想救她回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I just want to get her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.11,0:47:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的假期毁了 是又毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There goes my vacation. Again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.17,0:47:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 亲爱的 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, honey, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.64,0:47:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能找到那个你说会帮忙的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you able to get the man you said would help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.64,0:47:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.41,0:47:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}塞莱娜想爸爸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selena misses her daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.55,0:47:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 帕特里西奥 在吗 - 我能和爸爸说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Patricio? Hello? - Can I talk to Papa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.12,0:47:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 帕特里西奥 - 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Patricio? - Mama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.58,0:47:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你是谁 - 我能和爸爸说话吗 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is this? - Can I talk to Papa? Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.72,0:47:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帕特里西奥在哪 让我丈夫听电话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Patricio? Put my husband on the phone right…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.29,0:47:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他死前把这给你是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a reason he gave that to you before he died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.96,0:47:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许有我们需要的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might have the answers we need in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.58,0:47:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有瑞贝卡的手提电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have Rebecca's laptop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.37,0:48:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have leads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.54,0:48:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.24,0:48:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.19,0:49:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我成功地赋予了他们新的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I succeeded in reanimating them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.26,0:49:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我还没研究出\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I haven't figured out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.33,0:49:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如何防止身体腐烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to keep the bodies from rotting away… yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.17,0:49:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实践出真知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Practice makes perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.17,0:49:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}见见我的客人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet my guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.07,0:49:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的家人和我的一些挚友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family and some of my dearest friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.61,0:49:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瑞贝卡·钱伯斯教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Rebecca Chambers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.51,0:49:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.48,0:49:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是格伦·阿里亚斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Glenn Arias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.12,0:49:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据说你找到了我商品的解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you found a cure for my merchandise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.79,0:50:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}年纪轻轻就聪慧过人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}For someone so young, you're quite brilliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.57,0:50:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我找到的不只是解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cure isn't the only thing I found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.27,0:50:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.84,0:50:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请说下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, tell me more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.24,0:50:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我搞明白潜伏病毒是如何被激活的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured out how the latent virus is activated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.65,0:50:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兽性病毒 教授 简称A病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Animality Virus, Professor. A-Virus, for short.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.25,0:50:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的BOW能辨识攻击目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your BOWs can tell who they're supposed to attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.46,0:50:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是个不错的武器卖点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good selling point for a weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.59,0:50:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}改造出这种特性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engineering them with that trait{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.26,0:50:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定让你大费周折\N{\fnArial\fs30}must have been difficult for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.16,0:50:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我知道你是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know how you did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.50,0:50:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种病毒有三株\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are three strains of the virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.24,0:50:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一株感染他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}One infects them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.80,0:50:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二株作为触发物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A second acts as a trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.21,0:50:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第三株能让你选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}The third gives you the option{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.41,0:50:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的目标是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}of choosing who your target will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.18,0:50:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一种灭活病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sort of inactivation virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.62,0:51:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vaccine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.42,0:51:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再开次地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring up the map again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.26,0:51:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她一定认为这些疫情爆发事件有关联\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must have thought these outbreaks were related.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.19,0:51:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到它们都集中在大湖区周围吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See how they're all concentrated around the Great Lakes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.56,0:51:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果她说的是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If what she said is true, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.43,0:51:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这东西可以蛰伏在人体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this thing can lay dormant inside people, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.19,0:51:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天知道有多少人被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows how many are infected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.71,0:51:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把基础病毒混进了饮用水中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mixed the base virus in drinking water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.71,0:51:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm impressed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.68,0:51:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you figure it out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.51,0:51:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我注意到疫情爆发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I noticed a huge concentration{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.42,0:51:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大量集中在大湖区周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}of outbreaks around the Great Lakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.49,0:51:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那又正好是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which just so happens to be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.69,0:51:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}饮用水的主要来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}a major source of drinking water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.92,0:51:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那都不是你谋划的 而是偶发事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they weren't planned by you. They happened by accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.86,0:51:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在某些罕见的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems under certain rare conditions, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.50,0:51:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}潜伏病毒无需触发病毒就能被激活\N{\fnArial\fs30}the latent virus can activate without the trigger virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.90,0:51:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说到触发病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of, the trigger virus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.54,0:51:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很可能是用一种气体\N{\fnArial\fs30}is probably distributed through the air…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.71,0:51:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通过空气散播的\N{\fnArial\fs30}by a gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.21,0:52:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而这些病毒本身要么没有效力\N{\fnArial\fs30}By themselves, these viruses either have no potency, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.35,0:52:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要么有激活失败的风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}or they run the risk of activating on their own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.95,0:52:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但一旦结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when combined, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.72,0:52:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就会成为高效可控的生化武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}they become an effective, controllable bioweapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.42,0:52:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太棒了 教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicely done, Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.26,0:52:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难怪你能在浣熊市幸存\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no wonder you survived Raccoon City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.40,0:52:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果触发物是空气传播的 那就更难控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the trigger's airborne, it's harder to control{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.70,0:52:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它的去向或感染目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}where it goes or who gets it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.34,0:52:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以阿里亚斯一定用了某种疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So then Arias has to be using some type of vaccine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.64,0:52:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就是这样来控制疫情蔓延的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how he controls the spread of an outbreak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.84,0:52:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他先对他不想感染的人注射疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He vaccinates anyone he doesn't want infected first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.98,0:52:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样更有利于武器的精准性 看见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes for a more accurate weapon. See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.76,0:52:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你完成了对A病毒的研究功课\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done your homework on the A-Virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.91,0:52:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那接下来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now what's next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.87,0:52:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}研制试验解药对我并非难事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't hard for me to engineer a test cure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.84,0:52:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且现在我知道它有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now that I know it works, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.70,0:53:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的团队有我的研究资料和我的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}my team has my research and my blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.91,0:53:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你所谓的商品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your "merchandise, " as you put it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.97,0:53:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很快就会被市场淘汰\N{\fnArial\fs30}will soon be obsolete on the marketplace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.81,0:53:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想这么说 但你的研究并不完整\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to say this, but your research is incomplete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.35,0:53:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真正的解药 在注射后 你是不会被袭击的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you had found the cure, you wouldn't have been attacked after you took it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.73,0:53:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你还是被袭击了 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you were, weren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.90,0:53:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that it matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.70,0:53:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和你的疫苗将不久于世\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you and your vaccine will soon be out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.87,0:53:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明天 世界将会变得不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow, the world will be a different place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.04,0:53:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿里亚斯在谋划一起大事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arias is planning something big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.41,0:53:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帕特里西奥知道太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patricio knew way too much about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.01,0:53:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以他才被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's why he was killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.39,0:53:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.73,0:53:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们来杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came to kill you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.96,0:54:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可被杀的却是你爱的每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but killed everyone you loved instead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.64,0:54:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那天是你的婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was your wedding day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.37,0:54:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我来说 时间在那天停止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day time stopped for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.59,0:54:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Sara, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.39,0:54:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.80,0:54:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看起来很像她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look so much like her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.07,0:54:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的相遇并非巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a coincidence that we met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.08,0:54:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是天意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.15,0:54:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.62,0:55:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这是想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.30,0:55:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在重办婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm redoing the wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.67,0:55:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次是和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.05,0:55:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会重写过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll rewrite the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.89,0:55:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瑞贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.12,0:55:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来见下萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}meet Sara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.77,0:55:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会很幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to be so happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.06,0:56:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}转念一想\N{\fnArial\fs30}On second thought…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.17,0:56:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要把你的手臂换成萨拉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to replace your arm with Sara's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.14,0:56:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许这会改变你对我的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that will change your mind about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.89,0:56:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他要对纽约使用触发病毒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna use the trigger virus on New York?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.86,0:56:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看上去是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what it looks like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.19,0:56:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's out of his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.60,0:56:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果疫情爆发被认为无法控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If the outbreak is deemed uncontrollable, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.57,0:56:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}标有绿A的罐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}"tanks labeled with a green A{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.17,0:56:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}内有疫苗 可随时使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}"contain the vaccine and are ready to deploy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.50,0:56:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地点保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Location classified."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.11,0:56:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要做的就是找到那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we have to do is find that stuff, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.84,0:56:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后就能让所有人恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we can change everyone back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.54,0:57:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像按一个安全开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like flipping a safety switch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.18,0:57:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你是阿里亚斯 你会把它放哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you were Arias, where would you keep it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.42,0:57:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能快速到达的安全处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someplace he can get to fast. Someplace secure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.82,0:57:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在纽约的藏身处\N{\fnArial\fs30}His hideout in New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.69,0:57:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们也肯定会在那找到瑞贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I bet we'll find Rebecca there too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.44,0:57:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得快点散播\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to expedite the release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.40,0:57:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已安排在早高峰时段\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're set for morning rush hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.11,0:57:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有预感 BSAA会来碍事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a feeling the BSAA will be heading our way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.69,0:57:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我们需要对策\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we need that countermeasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.11,0:57:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在谋划另一场袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're planning another attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.95,0:57:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在谋划我们的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm planning our future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.25,0:57:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的时代就此开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our time starts now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.89,0:57:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们的 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Our"? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.63,0:57:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们将与我最后一位朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the last of my remaining friends, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.23,0:57:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一起开始新的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will begin our new life together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.71,0:58:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.85,0:58:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.60,0:58:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祝我好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish me luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.95,1:00:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.49,1:00:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亚历克斯 亚历克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex! Alex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.76,1:00:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我叫救护车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call the ambulance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.13,1:00:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在别打不通啊 该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now, goddamn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.09,1:01:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家都注射了一剂瑞贝卡的疫苗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody get a dose of Rebecca's vaccine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.23,1:01:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.17,1:01:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}增援部队的情况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the status on the reinforcements?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.44,1:01:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}BSAA和纽约警局特警队正在地面激战\N{\fnArial\fs30}BSAA and N.Y.P.D. SWAT are on the ground in the thick of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.91,1:01:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}州警还要三个小时才能到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The state police won't get there for another three hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.08,1:02:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就表示 我们必须靠自己抓捕阿里亚斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that means we have to nab Arias all by ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.14,1:02:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.31,1:02:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}情况越来越糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo! The signal's getting worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.29,1:02:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们在用油罐卡车喷射病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're using tanker trucks to spray the virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.96,1:02:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不是想转化一两千个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not trying to turn a couple thousand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.89,1:02:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是想转化所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's trying to turn them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.85,1:02:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得处理掉那些油罐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to take out those tankers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.69,1:02:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钱伯斯教授的研究报告称\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Chambers' research says{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.50,1:02:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种病毒不耐受热\N{\fnArial\fs30}the virus can't handle heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.13,1:02:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它和汽油的燃点一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got the same flash point as gasoline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.27,1:02:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完美 我们来点根火柴 看它燃烧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. Let's light a match, watch it burn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.33,1:02:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望我们能先去救瑞贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish we could get to Rebecca first, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.94,1:02:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那些油罐得优先处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the priority is those tankers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.48,1:02:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我们有三件事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we got three things to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.08,1:02:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一 炸掉油罐 二 救出瑞贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, blow up the tankers. Two, get Rebecca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.25,1:02:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三 夺取疫苗 将其配发全市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, grab the vaccine and deploy it on the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.85,1:02:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 还要抓住阿里亚斯 是四件事 - 你说了算 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And grab Arias. Four things. - Whatever you say, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.36,1:02:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}DC 纳蒂亚 你们在鱼鹰上行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}DC, Nadia, you guys work from the Osprey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.30,1:02:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}收到 克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that, C.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.19,1:03:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来自BSAA的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gifts from the BSAA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.65,1:03:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说他们目前只给我们弄这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said that's the best they can do for us for now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.54,1:03:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摩托车归我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dibs on the bike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.30,1:03:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}处理掉油罐 就去阿里亚斯那会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the tankers are down, rendezvous at Arias' place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.43,1:03:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可能要根据实际情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depending on the situation, we might have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.37,1:03:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先找到那疫苗 再去救瑞贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}to put Rebecca on hold until we find that vaccine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.05,1:03:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.94,1:04:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准备好没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you ready to rock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.71,1:04:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.04,1:04:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.47,1:05:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}达米安 见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damian! Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.21,1:05:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.53,1:05:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any ideas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.51,1:05:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来把狗引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll lead the dogs away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.54,1:05:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去再炸些油罐 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go blow up some more tankers. Good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.02,1:05:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.15,1:05:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来啊 伙计 来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, boy. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.40,1:07:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这版触发病毒比上一版更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This version of the trigger virus is better than the last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.91,1:07:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更强 你的血是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stronger. Your blood was the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.17,1:07:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.21,1:07:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不幸的是 增强毒性意味着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, increasing the toxicity means{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.81,1:07:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它没法再通过气体下毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}it can't be administered via gas anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.42,1:07:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 我恐怕得用注射这种老办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's back to the old needle, I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.68,1:07:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.92,1:07:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的模拟若正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}If our simulations were correct, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.79,1:07:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它就应该会在半小时后开始起效\N{\fnArial\fs30}it should start working in half an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.83,1:08:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已炸掉三辆 寻找下一辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three down. Going for the next one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.89,1:10:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴再次见到你 雷德菲尔德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to see you again, Mr. Redfield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.23,1:10:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿里亚斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.83,1:10:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多亏了钱伯斯教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to Professor Chambers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.66,1:10:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们把病毒变得更强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we made the virus much stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.63,1:10:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你能再待20分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can stick around for, oh, another 20 minutes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.84,1:10:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就会见识到有多强\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll see how strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.92,1:10:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我迫不及待地想要你见见被改进的全新瑞贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait for you to meet the new and improved Rebecca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.25,1:10:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.38,1:10:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对她下得了杀手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you have it in you to kill her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.09,1:10:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的死人大军会把\N{\fnArial\fs30}My army of the dead will change{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.79,1:10:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这世界变得更美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}the world for the better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.39,1:10:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这将纠正近几年战争导致的不平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will correct the imbalance caused by recent wars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.99,1:10:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你能活得够久\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you stay alive long enough, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.76,1:10:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就能和我看着我的BOW\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can watch with me as my BOWs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.10,1:10:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将那些最强大的国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}bring down the most powerful nations, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.70,1:10:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逐个击败\N{\fnArial\fs30}one by one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.34,1:10:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你该进精神病院 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You belong in a nuthouse, asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.98,1:10:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很遗憾 我没疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, I'm not crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.55,1:10:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.85,1:11:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在按下重启世界的按钮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hitting the reset button on the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.47,1:11:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的商品 我的BOW\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my merchandise, my BOWs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.83,1:11:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都很适合做这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}are the right tool for the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.24,1:12:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 里昂 - 抱歉 我来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leon. - Sorry I'm late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.93,1:12:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不得不走楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to take the stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.61,1:14:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许这就是我一直想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this is what I've always wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.54,1:14:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个在烈焰中的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}A world in flames, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.88,1:14:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只剩下死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}where only the dead remain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.25,1:14:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瑞贝卡的时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca's running out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.82,1:14:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们分头行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's split up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.70,1:15:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瑞贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.92,1:16:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.86,1:16:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chris…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.70,1:16:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别 等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.73,1:16:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}疫苗在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the vaccine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.73,1:16:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.85,1:17:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就一定要救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just had to try to save her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.15,1:17:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你太好揣测了 克里斯 这是你的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so predictable, Chris. That's your weakness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.38,1:17:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.67,1:20:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瑞贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.90,1:20:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.91,1:20:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.27,1:20:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会找到疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find the vaccine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.69,1:20:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再坚持会儿就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hang on a little longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.55,1:20:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪亚哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diego, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.08,1:20:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最终阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}the final stage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.05,1:20:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}释放吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unleash it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.00,1:22:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雷德菲尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redfield!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.07,1:24:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.84,1:25:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要把你断肠碎脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to spill your guts all over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.57,1:25:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}纳蒂亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nadia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.80,1:25:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪亚哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diego!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.31,1:25:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.74,1:26:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.44,1:27:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye, asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.93,1:28:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瑞贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.85,1:29:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一件事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more thing left to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.19,1:29:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.35,1:30:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}儿时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was a kid, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.97,1:30:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从未想到我的人生会变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought my life would turn out this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.77,1:30:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又一次 我们发现自己心回初衷\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once again, we find ourselves back where we started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.12,1:30:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.37,1:31:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们打倒坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got the bad guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.58,1:31:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望自己让世界变得更安全一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope we made the world a little safer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.76,1:31:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Chris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.23,1:31:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.51,1:31:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们这样能持续多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer can we keep going on like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.27,1:31:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.61,1:31:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从不考虑那么长远\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never make plans that far ahead.{\r}
